      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Creativity comparison\n\nModels: `kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors` (huggingface.co/hmdlsk/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0-ComfyUI) in `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` and the FLUX.1 VAE `ae.safetensors` in `ComfyUI/models/vae/`.\n\nOne loader feeds five upscalers (creativity 0, 2, 4, 6, 8), so the model is loaded once. Each output is saved with its setting in the filename prefix (`kandinsky_sr/x2_creativity_N`). Higher creativity is a stronger correction, not a quality dial: compare faces, text and fine textures against the input."
      ],
      "title": "Kandinsky ImageSR",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
